          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: In early March 2015 between 5:00 PM and 5:30 PM, a witness observed through the window of their kitchen three very bright, long, and flat shapes passing through the sky. Two other individuals also observed the phenomenon. Only one statement was collected. This observation of three brightly lit objects suggests airplanes reflecting sunlight at sunset (at low elevation, in flat light, airplane wings are nearly invisible). Since the exact date of this observation is unknown, it is not possible to conduct the necessary verifications. This case is classified \"C\" due to a lack of date information.",
